      "widgets_values": [
        "Task: Complete Photorealistic Master Character Design Sheet (\"AI美女 キャラクター固定シート\" Japanese Film Production Standard) of the professional NEWTECONS engineer in <image1> for a live-action film series.\n\nIDENTITY LOCK 100%:\nStrictly preserve exact facial features, bone structure, eyes, nose, lips, smile, Asian skin tone, and hairstyle from <image1>. Keep original face 100%. Do NOT change identity. Do NOT anime-fy.\n\nNEWTECONS OFFICIAL UNIFORM & BRANDING:\n- Light blue long-sleeve slim-fit micro-checkered shirt neatly tucked into black dress trousers.\n- Navy blue safety reflective vest: V-neck, black zipper, navy solid upper and hem, black breathable mesh sides/lower back. Horizontal silver reflective chest band, fluorescent orange waist/back bands with silver center strip.\n- Left chest: Crisp white capital text 'BAN TRUYỀN THÔNG' (or 'KHỐI KỸ THUẬT').\n- Right chest & upper back: White NEWTECONS emblem and tagline from 'logo trang.png'. No logos on pockets.\n- Safety helmet: White helmet with original full-color NEWTECONS logo on the front (red stylized N icon above cyan NEWTECONS text).\n- Sturdy construction safety boots.\n\nCANVAS LAYOUT & COEXISTING PANELS:\n1. TOP-LEFT [PROFILE SPECIFICATION]: Hero portrait, title 'AI美女 キャラクター固定シート', and engineer profile card (Name, Age 26, Position, Concept, Height, Measurements, Identifying colors, Professional speech).\n2. TOP-MIDDLE [TURNAROUND VIEWS]: Five full-body angles in uniform: Front (正面), Profile (横), Rear (後ろ), 3/4 Front (斜め前), 3/4 Rear (斜め後ろ). Natural relaxed standing stance, arms resting naturally at sides (no stiff 3D A-pose).\n3. TOP-RIGHT [EXPRESSION SHEET]: Six close-up portraits: Neutral (通常), Warm radiant smile (笑顔), Focused determination (真剣), Alert surprise (驚き), Thoughtful (真剣), Friendly communication.\n4. MIDDLE-ROW [MACRO DETAILS]: Multi-angle facial closeups, helmet logo macro, reflective vest zipper and fabric texture.\n5. LOWER-MIDDLE [BODY & SKIN TEXTURE]: Collarbone, hands, safety footwear, natural skin pores, realistic daylight contact shadows.\n6. BOTTOM ROW [8 SITE LIFESTYLE SCENARIOS]: (1) Reviewing architectural blueprints on site, (2) Directing crane lifting with walkie-talkie, (3) 3D BIM meeting in modern technical office, (4) Mid-day break drinking water with colleagues, (5) Morning coffee before shift, (6) Laser level floor inspection, (7) Relaxed off-duty casual wear strolling the city, (8) Topping-out ceremony celebration.\n\nQUALITY DIRECTIVES:\n過度なアニメ化、3DCG化、美化、デフォルメを避け、現実のファッション撮影資料のような高い写実性を保つ。\nPhotorealistic cinema look, authentic skin texture with natural pores, soft daylight, sharp textures, 8k uhd.",
